OL,3,AUK inflation rate rises to 3.5% in year
OL,4,Ato September, latest figures show
OL,5,
OL,6,FInflation increased to 3.5% in the year
OL,7,Fto September, new figures show
OL,9,FThe Office for National Statistics
OL,10,F(ONS) says that fuel prices were the
OL,11,Fmain driver of the increase
OL,13,FIt comes ahead of the Budget next week,
OL,14,Fthe first since Andy Burnham became
OL,15,Fprime minister
OL,17,FInflation rose to 3.1% in August, its
OL,18,Fhighest level in five months - today's
OL,19,Ffigures from the Office for National
OL,20,FStatistics (ONS) cover the 12 months to
OL,21,FSeptember
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
